        },
        {
          "text": "Nga Daudi acha Sikilaki, aaruma bibiindu bilala khu bie liie khu basaale bewe basaakhulu ba Yuda ne aloma ali, “siianwa siowo nisio sino khukhwama khu biindu bie liie bie basiku ba Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi.” ",
          "type": "text",
