            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aarumania bibiindu ebio khu baandu ba Beteli, Ramoti ne ebunafubo owa Yuda. Aarumanisilia akhaba Yatiri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
